{"vid":"nmqdyg4SKWI","source":"nmqdyg4SKWI.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":13,"txt":"Hazardous atmospheres in confined spaces"},{"t":15.9,"txt":"can be [music] lethal."},{"t":17.5,"txt":"Not only can they kill entrants, but"},{"t":20.1,"txt":"they can also be fatal to people who"},{"t":22.2,"txt":"rush in to rescue or assist them."},{"t":26.2,"txt":"Hazardous atmospheres typically can't be"},{"t":28.5,"txt":"identified with the naked eye. So,"},{"t":31.3,"txt":"testing for them is essential in"},{"t":33.4,"txt":"determining what safeguards should be"},{"t":35.9,"txt":"put in place before anyone enters a"},{"t":38.5,"txt":"confined space."},{"t":41.4,"txt":"The first test that OSHA requires"},{"t":44.4,"txt":"measures oxygen levels. Having either"},{"t":47.2,"txt":"[music] too much or too little oxygen"},{"t":49.6,"txt":"can make an atmosphere hazardous."},{"t":52.8,"txt":"When levels measure below 19.5%, [music]"},{"t":56.5,"txt":"a person can't breathe in enough oxygen"},{"t":59.1,"txt":"to do physical work safely. [music]"},{"t":62.3,"txt":"And oxygen levels above 23.5% [music]"},{"t":66.4,"txt":"can significantly increase the risk of a"},{"t":68.8,"txt":"spark or other ignition source [music]"},{"t":71.3,"txt":"causing a fire or explosion."},{"t":74.6,"txt":"After testing for oxygen is completed,"},{"t":77.4,"txt":"the space needs to be tested for"},{"t":79.6,"txt":"flammable gases and vapors, such as"},{"t":83,"txt":"methane, acetylene, carbon disulfide,"},{"t":86.3,"txt":"and gasoline."},{"t":88.4,"txt":"These can burst into flames or become"},{"t":90.6,"txt":"explosive if they build up any confined"},{"t":93.2,"txt":"area."},{"t":95.1,"txt":"If tests show that a gas or vapor has"},{"t":97.9,"txt":"reached a concentration greater than 10%"},{"t":101.1,"txt":"of its lower flammable limit, LFL,"},{"t":104.7,"txt":"then the space must be ventilated for"},{"t":107.2,"txt":"anyone to work in it."},{"t":109.8,"txt":"Combustible dusts can present a similar"},{"t":112.5,"txt":"hazard when their concentrations reach"},{"t":115,"txt":"or exceed their LFLs."},{"t":117.7,"txt":"So, testing must be performed to"},{"t":120.2,"txt":"accurately judge whether a dust"},{"t":122.3,"txt":"concentration is unsafe as well."},{"t":126.1,"txt":"The last test that must be conducted"},{"t":128.9,"txt":"before entering a confined space looks"},{"t":131.7,"txt":"for toxic contaminants in the space's"},{"t":133.9,"txt":"atmosphere."},{"t":135.6,"txt":"Carbon monoxide and hydrogen sulfide are"},{"t":138.6,"txt":"the two most commonly encountered"},{"t":140.5,"txt":"contaminants, but a number of others"},{"t":142.9,"txt":"need to be tested for as well."},{"t":146.1,"txt":"Breathing in these substances can cause"},{"t":148.4,"txt":"confusion, nausea, and vomiting, loss of"},{"t":151.8,"txt":"consciousness, even death."},{"t":155.3,"txt":"So, to ensure the ongoing safety of the"},{"t":157.9,"txt":"people who are entering a space, this"},{"t":160.6,"txt":"atmospheric testing must continue"},{"t":163.1,"txt":"throughout the entry."},{"t":166.1,"txt":"The results and times of the initial and"},{"t":169,"txt":"subsequent tests should be recorded on"},{"t":171.7,"txt":"the entry permit."}],"words":[{"t":13,"w":"Hazardous"},{"t":13.72,"w":"atmospheres"},{"t":14.48,"w":"in"},{"t":14.68,"w":"confined"},{"t":15.32,"w":"spaces"},{"t":15.92,"w":"can"},{"t":16.24,"w":"be"},{"t":16.375,"w":"[music]"},{"t":16.4,"w":"lethal."},{"t":17.52,"w":"Not"},{"t":17.88,"w":"only"},{"t":18.16,"w":"can"},{"t":18.4,"w":"they"},{"t":18.6,"w":"kill"},{"t":19.04,"w":"entrants,"},{"t":19.88,"w":"but"},{"t":20.08,"w":"they"},{"t":20.2,"w":"can"},{"t":20.4,"w":"also"},{"t":20.64,"w":"be"},{"t":20.84,"w":"fatal"},{"t":21.32,"w":"to"},{"t":21.48,"w":"people"},{"t":22,"w":"who"},{"t":22.2,"w":"rush"},{"t":22.48,"w":"in"},{"t":22.68,"w":"to"},{"t":22.88,"w":"rescue"},{"t":23.44,"w":"or"},{"t":23.72,"w":"assist"},{"t":24.2,"w":"them."},{"t":26.16,"w":"Hazardous"},{"t":26.76,"w":"atmos